        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūja kwikala kū Bafilisiti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho wideedeng'hanya ū mu ng'holò yakwe ūbona, “Ī gete lūshikū lūmò ū nkono go ng'wa Saulo gūkūnibūlaga. Na lūūlū ī haha gūtīho mhayo gūngī ū gwawiza ūyo nadūgije kūgwīta, ūlū ītī kūpeelela kū sī ya Bafilisiti dūhū; hūna ū Saulo akūgwa ng'holò ooye ū kwikala ūnikooba hose hose ū mu sī ya Isilaeli, nguno nakūbiza nīngaga ū mu nkono gwakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ng'hana ū Daūdi wīnga nabo a banhū bakwe abo magana atandatū, būja kū ng'wa Akishi ntemi wa Gaasi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Maoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi na a banhū bakwe būūkikala na Akishi kwenūko Gaasi; būlī ng'wene walī na kaya yakwe, ū Daūdi walī nabo a bake bakwe a babīlī, ū Ahinoamu wa Yezileeli nū Abigaili wa Kalimeli, ūyo akachīlwa ngoshi Nabaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo aho wawīlwa gīkī ū Daūdi wapeelelile Gaasi, ooya ū kwikala akūnkoobaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū Akishi, “Ūlū ūlīnibona ū mu miso gako gīkī nigeleelilwe kwanukūlwa, nilolalolelage ipandī lya kwikala mu nzengo gūmò gwaho ū mu mizengo ya mu sī yako, nikale kwenūko; ī gīsī īlīho nguno kī ū ntūmami wako ū kwikala ng'wikūlū hamò nang'ho?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū lūshikū lwenūlo ū Akishi ūng'winha ū Daūdi nzengo gwa Zikilagi; kwandīja ikanza lyenīlo kūshisha lelo ū nzengo gwenūyo gūmanīīkile gīkī gwa batemi ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi akikala ū mu sī ya Bafilisiti ikanza lya ng'waka ngima na myeji īnè.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kikalīle ka ng'wa Daūdi mu Zikilagi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū, ū Daūdi na a banhū bakwe bajaga kūbadumīla Bageshuli, Bagelizi, na Baamaleki. (Kūfuma shikū ja kale a banhū benabo baalī bikaji ba mu sī jenījo, kwandīja Shūūli kūshisha mhandī ja Misili.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī kwene ūko wajaga kūbadumīla ū Daūdi walī atalekaga munhū ose ose mpanga, abize ngosha nūūlū nkīma. Alīyo ī ng'holo wasolaga, nī ng'ombe, nī nzobe, nī ngamīla, pyī nī shizwalo; washisolaga washenha ū kūlī Akishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Akishi ūlū wamūūja, “Lelo ng'walwaaga na bana halī?” Ū Daūdi wang'wīlaga, “Twalī Negevu ya Yuda,” nūūlū “Negevu ya Yelahimeeli,” nūūlū “Negevu ya Bakeni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī atalekeelaga munhū ose ose ngosha nūūlū nkīma, gīkī ang'wenhe kūlī Akishi; nguno ū Daūdi wiganikaga, “Bakūtūbūūla bahaye gīkī, ‘Īyo wītaga ū Daūdi yīyī na yīyī.’” Na lūūlū ī yenīyo hū'ī mbika ya kikalīle kaakwe pyī ī likanza īlo walī ū mu sī ya Bafilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Akishi akansanya no ū Daūdi, ūyiganika, “Ū ng'wenūyū akūbiza ntūmami wane wilalī nguno wanung'hile inyema ū kū banhū bakwe a Baisilaeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
